<title>USA: Websecure files for stock, warrant IPO.</title>
<headline>Websecure files for stock, warrant IPO.</headline>
<dateline>SAUGUS, Mass. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		    WebSecure Inc</p>
<p>Estimated price range		    $6-8</p>
<p>Number of Shares		  1.0 million</p>
<p>Warrants to be issued	   1.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 1.0 million</p>
<p>Underwriters	  Coburn &amp; Meredith, Shamrock Partners</p>
<p>Business: A development stage company offering Internet access and support services for secure commercial transactions and communications over the Internet.</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment option: 150,000 shares</p>
</text>
